{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
    "name": "AUTHORITY API",
    "description": "Collection AUTHORITY — importer avec l'environnement `AUTHORITY — Local`.\n\n**Parcours SOC-11 Settings (Collection Runner, dans l'ordre) :**\n1. Health → Live\n2. Identity → Login\n3. Organization → 0 List companies\n4. Organization → 1 Set context\n5. Settings → 0 Effective\n6. Settings → 1 Update theme\n7. Settings → 2 Pref ne donne pas permission admin\n\n**Parcours complet (autres lots) :** voir dossiers Organization, License, Platform.\n\nLes cookies de session sont geres automatiquement apres le Login.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Live",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health/live"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ready",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health/ready"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Identity",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login OK', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('sessionId', body.session.id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionId', body.session.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@authority.local\",\n  \"password\": \"DemoPass123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Authenticated', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update me (creates audit + outbox)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Update me OK (200)', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
                  "  console.warn('401 : faites Login avant cette requete.');",
                  "}",
                  "if (pm.response.code >= 500) {",
                  "  console.warn('500 : l API est peut-etre arretee. npm run dev:api');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"displayName\": \"Demo Operator\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Permissions catalog",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/permissions/catalog"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Check permission",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"permissionKey\": \"identity.self.read\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/permissions/check"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Revoke session",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/identity/sessions/{{sessionId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Organization",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0 — List companies (remplit companyId)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Companies listed', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const companies = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const demo = companies.find(function (c) { return c.code === 'DEMO'; });",
                  "  if (demo) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('companyId', demo.id);",
                  "    console.log('companyId = ' + demo.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/companies"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1 — Set context (company only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('companyId')) {",
                  "  throw new Error('companyId vide : faites 0 — List companies avant');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"companyId\": \"{{companyId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/me/context"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2 — List sites (remplit siteId)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Sites listed', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const sites = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (sites.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('siteId', sites[0].id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/companies/{{companyId}}/sites"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3 — Set context (company + site) SOC-09",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.environment.get('siteId')) {",
                  "  console.warn('siteId vide : faites 1 puis 2 avant cette requete');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"companyId\": \"{{companyId}}\",\n  \"siteId\": \"{{siteId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/me/context"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get context",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/me/context"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get company DEMO",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/companies/{{companyId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create site (SOC-10)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"code\": \"DEP1\",\n  \"type\": \"DEPOT\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/companies/{{companyId}}/sites"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "IDOR — other company (expect 403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('IDOR blocked', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organization/companies/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "License",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
